OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABlind man left 'vulnerable' by bus
OL,4,Astop challenges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blind man has said he felt vulnerable
OL,7,Fwhile "stuck waiting" at night in
OL,8,FBrighton when unable to catch a bus due
OL,9,Fto accessibility issues.
OL,11,FDaniel Walker said he "couldn't get
OL,12,Freliable information" on where his bus
OL,13,Fwas while waiting at a stop in
OL,14,FChurchill Square or reach Brighton &
OL,15,FHove Buses' customer service line as it
OL,16,Fwas closed when he tried to call it at
OL,17,F22:00 GMT.
OL,19,F"Twice, while I was asking another bus
OL,20,Fdriver about my bus, it stopped behind
OL,21,Ftheirs and left without me," he posted
OL,22,Fon Facebook.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
